Third-party software
====================

CNTRL invokes the following tools as separate programs. They are not
vendored or linked; each is installed from the host's package manager.

rclone — https://rclone.org
  Backups and restores of the state dir (backend/backup.py) shell out to
  rclone, including its crypt backend for the optional encrypted secrets.
  Copyright (C) 2012 by Nick Craig-Wood http://www.craig-wood.com/nick/
  Licensed under the MIT License:
  https://github.com/rclone/rclone/blob/master/COPYING

Third-party data
================

models.dev — https://models.dev
  backend/providers_catalog.json (the LLM provider + model catalogue: base
  URLs, context windows, prices) is derived from the models.dev api.json by
  scripts/refresh_providers.py. Prices are community-maintained.
  Copyright (c) 2025 models.dev
  Licensed under the MIT License:
  https://github.com/sst/models.dev/blob/dev/LICENSE

